  "recommendations": [
    "Implement route-based code splitting to reduce initial bundle size",
    "Use WebP/AVIF images to reduce image payload",
    "Enable text compression (gzip/brotli) for all text resources",
    "Implement resource hints (preload, prefetch) for critical resources",
    "Use service worker for aggressive caching of static resources",
    "Optimize font loading with font-display: swap",
    "Minimize unused JavaScript and CSS",
    "Implement lazy loading for non-critical components",
    "Use CDN for static assets to improve TTFB",
    "Monitor and optimize third-party script impact"
